3. Datasets
-----------

The package ships derived quantities only (metrics, cut indices, file
hashes and per-column variances of the benign training stretch), never
records of the datasets. The four corpora are obtained from their
publishers under their own terms: the Kitsune Network Attack Dataset,
ACI-IoT-2023, CIC-IDS2017 and CSE-CIC-IDS2018. data/streams.json lists
the files that were read, with their sizes and sha256.
